---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base title="About Silit Labs" description="Silit Labs is a small product studio in Antalya, Turkey. We make patient document kits and templates for clinics, and Flowdeck, a monitoring panel for Webflow agencies.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">About</li></ol>
      <span class="kicker">About</span>
      <h1>A small studio that builds the tools it needed</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose lead-prose">
        <p>Silit Labs is a product studio based in Antalya, Turkey. Our day job is marketing for clinics in medical tourism and running the Webflow sites behind them.</p>
        <p>In that work we kept seeing the same gaps. Great clinics sent patients plain Word files with mixed fonts and half-finished aftercare notes. Agencies found out a client site was down when the client called. So we started building the things we wished we had, and then made them good enough to sell.</p>
        <p>The clinic kits come from years of preparing patient documents for international patients. Their medical texts are general templates based on published clinical guidance, written to be reviewed and adapted by each clinic's own clinicians. Flowdeck came from looking after many Webflow sites at once.</p>
        <p>We keep prices low on purpose. A clinic in its first year should be able to look as professional as one in its twentieth, and a freelancer with one site should get the same monitoring as an agency with forty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="facts-box">
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Antalya, Turkey</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Founded</dt><dd>2026</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Products</dt><dd><a href="/clinic-kits/">Clinic kits</a>, <a href="/templates/">Templates</a>, <a href="/webflow-apps/flowdeck/">Flowdeck</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Where to buy</dt><dd><a href={SITE.etsy} rel="noopener">Etsy</a>, and direct by email</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Contact</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .lead-prose p { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .lead-prose p:first-child { color: var(--ink); }
  .lead-prose p + p { color: var(--muted); }
  .facts-box { background: var(--sheet); border-radius: 24px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line); align-self: start; }
  .facts-box dl > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .facts-box dl > div:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .facts-box dt { color: var(--muted); }
  .facts-box dd { font-weight: 600; }
  .facts-box a { color: var(--blue); }
</style>
